WEBVTT

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:10.505
If only I had realized it sooner...

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.668
...I may have been
able to save them.

00:00:16.082 --> 00:00:19.017
If only I had realized it sooner...

00:00:19.886 --> 00:00:22.252
...I may have been
able to protect them.

00:00:23.656 --> 00:00:25.792
If only I had known the
simple truth...

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:28.795
...that people need air...

00:00:28.795 --> 00:00:32.822
...water and food in order to live.

00:00:33.533 --> 00:00:35.626
That obvious truth...

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:40.870
If only I had realized sooner.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:47.880
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:00:58.758 --> 00:00:59.520
The city...!

00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:05.990
It's coming!

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.174
What is this...?!

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.511
What on Earth is going on...?!

00:02:00.353 --> 00:02:02.844
How dare you do this?

00:02:09.429 --> 00:02:10.521
Did I do it?

00:02:15.068 --> 00:02:15.625
Ashura!

00:02:35.121 --> 00:02:35.951
No way!

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:38.651
Ashura!

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.564
There's no end to them.

00:03:26.573 --> 00:03:27.699
You fool.

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:34.038
What?

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:38.810
What have you come here to do?

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:41.377
Chris...

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.689
What for?

00:03:46.459 --> 00:03:47.794
What for?!

00:03:47.794 --> 00:03:51.525
I mean, that's obvious!
To save Tokio and the others!

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.191
Save?

00:03:54.667 --> 00:03:57.465
You're not aware of a single thing...

00:03:57.704 --> 00:04:00.571
...even about those
closest to you.

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:03.476
What about you?!

00:04:03.476 --> 00:04:06.775
How could you have left Raaja
alone until it got this bad?!

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:15.054
It is because the Raaja is me.

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:16.646
And I am the Raaja.

00:04:17.624 --> 00:04:18.113
Huh?!

00:04:19.058 --> 00:04:20.787
Because I am the Raaja.

00:04:23.129 --> 00:04:24.731
What're you talking about?

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:26.961
Don't you understand yet?

00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:29.235
The Raaja and I...

00:04:29.235 --> 00:04:32.466
...were one and the same
from the beginning.

00:04:33.206 --> 00:04:34.002
No way...

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:41.814
How can...?

00:04:41.814 --> 00:04:45.118
So, you weren't trying to
save the Raaja...

00:04:45.118 --> 00:04:48.110
...but you were in fact
the Raaja itself?

00:04:49.822 --> 00:04:50.584
That's horrible.

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.254
That means you are
responsible for this?!

00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:56.529
Juna...

00:04:56.529 --> 00:04:59.794
What is your body made from?

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:02.663
Well, that's...

00:05:09.575 --> 00:05:11.311
Yes.

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:13.146
From the air and water...

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:15.171
...and other living things.

00:05:16.616 --> 00:05:18.885
To pollute this planet...

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.785
...is to pollute your own self.

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:24.223
Those who pollute themselves...

00:05:24.223 --> 00:05:27.056
...can only be
destroying themselves.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:28.852
What?

00:05:29.228 --> 00:05:31.788
Why didn't you
tell me sooner?

00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:33.799
Why didn't you?

00:05:35.401 --> 00:05:37.801
I've told you that over and over.

00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:39.268
What?

00:05:39.472 --> 00:05:41.804
Over and over...

00:05:47.013 --> 00:05:48.173
...I've told you.

00:05:48.414 --> 00:05:49.904
Long ago.

00:05:50.917 --> 00:05:52.111
I've told you.

00:05:53.419 --> 00:05:54.681
I've told you.

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:57.186
I've told you...

00:05:58.424 --> 00:05:59.525
However...

00:05:59.525 --> 00:06:02.619
...you did not see despite
your eyes.

00:06:03.262 --> 00:06:05.492
You did not hear despite
your ears.

00:06:05.665 --> 00:06:07.565
Or smell despite your nose.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:09.725
Taste despite your tongue.

00:06:10.403 --> 00:06:13.395
You did not feel despite
your sense of touch.

00:06:16.242 --> 00:06:17.231
No!

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:21.945
No!

00:06:37.997 --> 00:06:38.931
No!

00:06:38.931 --> 00:06:40.091
You mustn't shoot Chris!

00:06:40.366 --> 00:06:40.627
What?

00:06:43.436 --> 00:06:46.105
Get out of the way!
I have to kill that monster!

00:06:46.105 --> 00:06:48.801
No! If you kill Chris,
Earth will be...

00:06:49.208 --> 00:06:50.209
What?

00:06:50.209 --> 00:06:51.444
Listen.

00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:53.780
If you kill TI-1 now...

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:57.583
...the energy of an Ultra-Raaja will
be released from within his body...

00:06:57.583 --> 00:07:00.219
...then travel through the lay lines
of the Japanese archipelago...

00:07:00.219 --> 00:07:02.483
...resulting in a major
magnetic anomaly.

00:07:03.489 --> 00:07:05.491
It will result in the disappearance
of the Van Allen Belt...

00:07:05.491 --> 00:07:07.360
...a major shift in the
tectonic plates...

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:11.296
...and the subsequent annihilation
of all life on Earth.

00:07:11.931 --> 00:07:12.795
Annihilation?

00:07:23.009 --> 00:07:23.839
What?!

00:07:24.844 --> 00:07:26.106
Chris is...

00:07:40.593 --> 00:07:41.890
No way!

00:07:43.663 --> 00:07:45.531
TI-1 Earth Aura Wave...

00:07:45.531 --> 00:07:47.500
...synchronizing with
the surface Raajas.

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.627
Also synchronizing with lay lines!
Currently amplifying!

00:07:50.837 --> 00:07:54.907
So TI-1 and all of the
Raajas are now one.

00:07:54.907 --> 00:07:55.975
TI-2...

00:07:55.975 --> 00:07:59.278
...I want you to hit the lay lines
below the Ultra-Raaja right now.

00:07:59.278 --> 00:08:00.506
Lay lines?

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.014
That's right.

00:08:02.014 --> 00:08:05.485
I want you to use your power
to create a space shield...

00:08:05.485 --> 00:08:07.954
...within the lay lines
below the Ultra-Raaja.

00:08:07.954 --> 00:08:09.822
You must seal off all
the Raajas...

00:08:09.822 --> 00:08:11.624
...into the Ryutai Islands...

00:08:11.624 --> 00:08:13.990
...at the bottom of Japan.

00:08:14.894 --> 00:08:16.828
Seal them off in Japan?

00:08:17.096 --> 00:08:19.131
What'll happen to Japan, then?

00:08:19.131 --> 00:08:20.700
What about the people here?!

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:23.260
I would say that Japan
will disappear.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:26.305
The powers of all the Raajas
and the lay line energy...

00:08:26.305 --> 00:08:29.075
...will reduce all mass
to subatomic levels...

00:08:29.075 --> 00:08:30.872
...extinguishing it from the Earth.

00:08:31.244 --> 00:08:32.575
Extinguish?

00:08:32.812 --> 00:08:33.613
Commander!

00:08:33.613 --> 00:08:35.181
It can't be avoided.

00:08:35.181 --> 00:08:39.285
We can no longer protect
the life of this island nation...

00:08:39.285 --> 00:08:41.776
...that has been maintained
since ancient times.

00:08:43.155 --> 00:08:44.554
No way.

00:08:49.262 --> 00:08:50.194
W-Water...

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:51.528
Water...

00:08:52.732 --> 00:08:55.667
But I don't know where...

00:08:56.702 --> 00:08:57.327
Water...

00:08:58.905 --> 00:08:59.599
Sayuri?

00:08:59.872 --> 00:09:00.429
Sayuri!

00:09:00.640 --> 00:09:02.174
Come on! Talk to me, Sayuri!

00:09:02.174 --> 00:09:03.141
Sayuri!

00:09:04.176 --> 00:09:04.972
Tokio?!

00:09:05.311 --> 00:09:06.879
Hurry up and hit the lay lines.

00:09:06.879 --> 00:09:07.713
No way!

00:09:07.713 --> 00:09:09.382
If I do that Japan will be...

00:09:09.382 --> 00:09:11.117
Tokio and the others will be...!

00:09:11.117 --> 00:09:15.988
Even if this nation were to be
destroyed, its soul will remain.

00:09:15.988 --> 00:09:20.059
The memory of a people who lived
in this small island country...

00:09:20.059 --> 00:09:22.628
...will remain in the voices of insects
and even in the pebbles...

00:09:22.628 --> 00:09:25.097
...where one could feel
the breath of the Earth.

00:09:25.097 --> 00:09:27.800
That there once lived a people
who sacrificed...

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:30.836
...their lives to protect
the life on this planet...

00:09:30.836 --> 00:09:32.167
...will be remembered.

00:09:34.907 --> 00:09:35.839
No way!

00:09:36.442 --> 00:09:37.670
Forget memories!

00:09:38.177 --> 00:09:41.247
Right now, all that matters
is whether people live or die!

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:44.239
Memories aren't going
to solve anything!

00:09:51.157 --> 00:09:52.491
How dare she...

00:09:52.491 --> 00:09:54.860
She doesn't see yet.

00:09:54.860 --> 00:09:55.485
Go after her.

00:10:07.673 --> 00:10:13.634
Earth Maiden Arjuna

00:10:15.881 --> 00:10:17.872
Sayuri...

00:10:18.551 --> 00:10:19.745
Damn.

00:10:20.052 --> 00:10:23.613
If only I was able to
feed her something.

00:10:27.259 --> 00:10:28.861
Hey, Tokio.

00:10:28.861 --> 00:10:32.888
Why do insects know
which leaves they can eat...

00:10:34.133 --> 00:10:36.124
...but I didn't know anything?

00:10:36.702 --> 00:10:39.170
I didn't know what I could eat.

00:10:40.439 --> 00:10:41.838
It's so true.

00:10:42.975 --> 00:10:45.876
How could things
have come to this?

00:10:52.385 --> 00:10:54.148
Juna...

00:11:11.537 --> 00:11:13.027
Gotta go...!

00:11:14.040 --> 00:11:15.064
Gotta go!

00:11:23.616 --> 00:11:24.810
What is it?

00:11:30.222 --> 00:11:30.881
Sour!

00:11:32.324 --> 00:11:33.154
Tokio!

00:11:34.427 --> 00:11:35.594
Sayuri...

00:11:35.594 --> 00:11:36.583
Sayuri...!

00:11:46.706 --> 00:11:47.604
Sayuri!

00:11:48.441 --> 00:11:50.238
Thank God!

00:11:51.544 --> 00:11:52.841
Oshima...

00:11:56.048 --> 00:11:57.208
Juna?

00:11:59.285 --> 00:12:00.377
Juna...?!

00:12:00.586 --> 00:12:01.917
Is it really you?!

00:12:02.388 --> 00:12:03.753
Thank goodness...

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:06.524
...that both you and Sayuri
are all right.

00:12:15.968 --> 00:12:16.802
Uh, Tokio...

00:12:16.802 --> 00:12:18.270
...did you...

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:21.000
...did you find that on your own?

00:12:22.975 --> 00:12:23.737
You mean this?

00:12:25.144 --> 00:12:27.613
I wasn't sure what happened...

00:12:27.613 --> 00:12:29.482
...but it felt like it was calling me.

00:12:29.482 --> 00:12:30.779
Calling?

00:12:30.983 --> 00:12:31.642
Yeah.

00:12:32.685 --> 00:12:34.084
A sweet-and-sour smell...

00:12:35.054 --> 00:12:36.088
Did you really...

00:12:36.088 --> 00:12:37.851
...did you really find it
on your own?

00:12:40.359 --> 00:12:41.690
Tokio...

00:12:45.498 --> 00:12:48.300
You're not aware of a single thing...

00:12:48.300 --> 00:12:50.669
...even about those closest to you.

00:12:50.669 --> 00:12:51.966
What?

00:12:52.171 --> 00:12:54.833
Don't tell me he knew all along...

00:12:55.207 --> 00:12:58.938
...that Tokio would survive because
he'd find food on his own.

00:12:59.712 --> 00:13:02.203
It's too late for you to
realize that now!

00:13:02.414 --> 00:13:03.176
Cindy!

00:13:12.858 --> 00:13:15.728
Chris knew that all along!

00:13:15.728 --> 00:13:18.097
But you just couldn't see it.

00:13:18.097 --> 00:13:21.400
You didn't even understand
anything about your boyfriend!!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:22.662
But...

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:26.639
Chris believed in you!

00:13:26.639 --> 00:13:29.642
That you would surely realize it!
He believed...

00:13:29.642 --> 00:13:32.543
...he believed all along!

00:13:33.579 --> 00:13:34.910
Cindy...

00:13:36.282 --> 00:13:39.911
...is that why he wouldn't
tell me anything?

00:13:40.219 --> 00:13:43.088
Is it because he believed in me...?

00:13:43.088 --> 00:13:46.683
That I would realize it
on my own?

00:13:47.026 --> 00:13:50.587
But how could
Chris have known...

00:13:51.030 --> 00:13:53.658
...about Tokio like that?

00:13:55.201 --> 00:13:57.536
It is because the Raaja is me.

00:13:57.536 --> 00:13:59.367
And I am the Raaja.

00:13:59.772 --> 00:14:00.363
Huh?

00:14:02.608 --> 00:14:06.135
The food I eat is going to be
part of my body. It's part of me.

00:14:06.779 --> 00:14:07.837
Me?

00:14:08.581 --> 00:14:10.310
But what am I?

00:14:10.516 --> 00:14:12.313
You'll be all right, Yukari.

00:14:16.188 --> 00:14:17.489
Chris...!

00:14:17.489 --> 00:14:20.287
Don't tell me even Tokio
and Chris are...

00:14:22.895 --> 00:14:26.331
...Tokio and Chris are
one and the same?

00:14:43.148 --> 00:14:45.378
Waves and waves...

00:14:46.485 --> 00:14:51.718
...waves and waves
pile up over each other.

00:14:58.697 --> 00:15:00.289
Those with life...

00:15:02.134 --> 00:15:03.692
...and those without.

00:15:07.573 --> 00:15:09.632
Things that are seen...

00:15:12.244 --> 00:15:14.269
...and things that are not.

00:15:23.489 --> 00:15:27.516
Things outside the body
and things within.

00:15:29.428 --> 00:15:34.092
Everything that takes place
on this planet...

00:15:56.555 --> 00:15:57.852
Forms...

00:15:59.258 --> 00:16:01.590
...and shapes may be different...

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.120
They may be different...

00:16:07.566 --> 00:16:09.898
...but everything is...

00:16:30.289 --> 00:16:31.390
Take care of the rest.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:32.254
Yes, sir!

00:16:42.501 --> 00:16:44.837
Sayuri...

00:16:44.837 --> 00:16:45.804
Yukari...

00:16:46.005 --> 00:16:46.972
I get it.

00:16:47.406 --> 00:16:49.842
Everything is one and the same.

00:16:49.842 --> 00:16:52.072
That's why Tokio and Chris...

00:16:52.745 --> 00:16:56.943
...and myself were all one
before we were born.

00:16:57.783 --> 00:16:59.944
I understand it clearly now.

00:17:00.552 --> 00:17:02.850
It's not a question of mere faith.

00:17:03.789 --> 00:17:05.190
What are you talking about?

00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:09.718
To say you and he and Chris
are the same isn't right at all!

00:17:10.295 --> 00:17:12.490
But that's okay.

00:17:13.632 --> 00:17:15.300
The grasses and insects...

00:17:15.300 --> 00:17:16.597
...the people and wind...

00:17:16.935 --> 00:17:19.104
...everything is one because
they're all different.

00:17:19.104 --> 00:17:19.695
What?

00:17:19.905 --> 00:17:21.006
Why's that?

00:17:21.006 --> 00:17:22.633
Even if they're different?

00:17:30.215 --> 00:17:32.740
I am Chris.

00:17:33.919 --> 00:17:35.944
I am Raaja.

00:17:39.591 --> 00:17:41.616
Don't tell me you're thinking of...

00:17:41.827 --> 00:17:44.363
You don't plan on taking Chris'
place and sealing the Raaja...

00:17:44.363 --> 00:17:45.455
...within your body?!

00:17:46.165 --> 00:17:48.133
I'm not sealing anything.

00:17:48.133 --> 00:17:49.964
We are all one to begin with.

00:17:51.904 --> 00:17:52.768
One?

00:17:53.439 --> 00:17:55.207
However...

00:17:55.207 --> 00:17:59.610
...that was a treacherous path
even for Chris.

00:18:06.385 --> 00:18:07.586
No way!

00:18:07.586 --> 00:18:09.354
There's no way you can do it!

00:18:09.354 --> 00:18:12.221
Do you know how much
Chris has suffered?

00:18:12.357 --> 00:18:14.626
Do you know how much
pain he had to endure...

00:18:14.626 --> 00:18:17.196
...by having the Raaja eating away
at his body?

00:18:17.196 --> 00:18:19.790
There's no way you can handle it!

00:18:22.768 --> 00:18:25.202
I actually knew it.

00:18:27.072 --> 00:18:28.164
It's true.

00:18:30.309 --> 00:18:33.579
So, no matter how happy
I may have been...

00:18:33.579 --> 00:18:35.781
...I might suddenly feel empty.

00:18:35.781 --> 00:18:39.581
Or even when I'm close to Tokio,
I'd suddenly get sad.

00:18:40.252 --> 00:18:42.982
I must've been feeling it
in my heart.

00:18:43.956 --> 00:18:46.288
The pain and sorrow
of this planet.

00:18:46.859 --> 00:18:50.295
But I kept pretending
that I didn't know.

00:18:55.033 --> 00:18:59.527
That's why I think I'll try
and feel the "here and now."

00:19:00.906 --> 00:19:02.669
His suffering.

00:19:04.209 --> 00:19:05.144
After all...

00:19:05.144 --> 00:19:10.013
...this is the "here and now"
of me and this planet.

00:19:10.382 --> 00:19:12.009
This is the very moment.

00:19:14.086 --> 00:19:15.519
Chris!

00:19:19.124 --> 00:19:19.920
Juna...

00:19:20.993 --> 00:19:22.119
Tokio.

00:20:38.270 --> 00:20:39.498
The monsters...

00:21:04.396 --> 00:21:05.363
Juna!

00:21:06.198 --> 00:21:07.062
Chris!

00:21:07.666 --> 00:21:08.928
Chris!

00:21:09.268 --> 00:21:10.098
Cin...

00:21:10.869 --> 00:21:11.392
What?

00:21:13.739 --> 00:21:16.105
Cindy...

00:21:17.609 --> 00:21:18.473
Chris!

00:21:25.884 --> 00:21:26.976
Chris...?

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:32.053
You have such a gentle look
on your face.

00:21:36.795 --> 00:21:37.557
Juna.

00:21:44.336 --> 00:21:46.201
Your voice...

00:21:49.608 --> 00:21:50.438
Huh?

00:21:57.316 --> 00:22:00.218
The Raaja's being eaten
by the insects and lizards.

00:22:00.218 --> 00:22:01.687
Juna just said that.

00:22:01.687 --> 00:22:02.312
What?

00:22:02.954 --> 00:22:05.290
That Raaja is edible.

00:22:05.290 --> 00:22:06.257
What?

00:22:06.425 --> 00:22:07.756
Edible?

00:22:10.195 --> 00:22:13.756
The Raaja is the same as
the insects that eat leaves.

00:22:14.466 --> 00:22:17.869
It eats the things that cannot
return to the land as they are.

00:22:17.869 --> 00:22:19.237
It cleanses them...

00:22:19.237 --> 00:22:22.541
...and returns them as life that
can be eaten by the people...

00:22:22.541 --> 00:22:23.974
...grasses and all living things.

00:22:24.242 --> 00:22:26.437
Life that can be eaten?

00:22:31.450 --> 00:22:34.219
So, in order to do that...

00:22:34.219 --> 00:22:36.449
...it came up from the sea...

00:22:37.356 --> 00:22:42.123
...to bring life back
to this wasted land...

00:22:42.728 --> 00:22:44.855
...as the holy food of life.

00:23:38.984 --> 00:23:40.849
Thank you.

00:23:46.825 --> 00:23:48.026
A time to which one can never return to...

00:23:48.026 --> 00:23:50.962
A time to which one can never return to...
